WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.460
Yo what’s good?

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:13.700
This week we throwin up the west side with Grapes of Wrath by John Steinbeck.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.640
After doin time for mercin some
fool,

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:26.180
Tom Joad gets released from the big house and shoots the sh*t with Jim Casy, who used to be a preacher back in the day.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:31.680
Together these cats drop in on the Joad family farm, 
but the place is dead!

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.340
Where the hell is everybody?

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.480
Apparently the bank dun run dem
broke-ass scrubs outta they own digs

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.100
and now Tom’s family kickin it over at Uncle John’s crib.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:47.320
So our boys slide over to Uncle J’s
spot where the whole family packin their sh*t in some hoopty-ass truck.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:50.420
Word on the street
is there’s so much work in California,

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:54.580
homies basically throwin cash at anyone who got the
juice to hustle.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:01:00.860
And since the Dustbowl dun f**ked up their hood, Casy and the Joads got to start trekkin to the West Side.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:07.220
As they swangin and bangin down Route 66, they peep a whole bunch of other homies who got the same idea.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:13.640
Some even say the work-scene in Cali is all cashed out, and errybody cruisin over there for no good reason.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:17.620
And when they reach Cali, it turns
out it ain’t all peaches and creme.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:20.200
With so many homies tryin to hustle
fo dat dough,

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:24.940
all dem shysti capitalist big-dawgs can pay out jack sh*t to hungry hoods

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:28.060
who ain’t got no choice but to keep grindin for bread.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:31.480
But not errybody just lettin them
rich folks walk all over em.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:33.960
When the Joads get a little work pickin peaches,

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:40.700
Casy and some other righteous ballas go on strike and try to organize the workers to step up to dat 1%.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.260
Eventually the sh*t goes down:

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:50.800
Tom peeps Casy gettin his head busted open by some strike breaker, so Tom keeps it street and straight ICES that punk.

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:55.920
Since he still on parole, Tom gotta
leave the family so he can lay low from the po-lice.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:00.520
Now he can spend his time spreadin
Casy’s righteous word bout helpin brothas out.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:07.060
After gettin flooded outta their spot, the Joads roll up on some little kid and his daddy who bout to starve to death.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.140
Tom’s sister Rose of Sharon decide she gonna step up:

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:15.080
She whips out dat tit-tay and lets him just suck the milk out so he won’t die.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:18.200
Mmm! Milk does a body good!

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:26.580
Look- errybody know it sucks a fat
one to be straight tapped out with no job.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:30.700
But during the Great Depression, these cats
were hurtin on a whole nother level —

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:32.740
like some o dat Old Testament suffering.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:37.420
And in dis book, ain’t no doubt
Steinbeck goin straight Ol' Testament on our asses.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:42.180
The Dustbowl that dun f**ked up all the Joad’s grubbins reppin the plagues in Egypt,

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.660
the trek to the West Side reppin the exodus from Egypt,

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:49.520
and all them haters up in Cali actin just like the
tribes of Canaan.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:53.500
But ol' Johnny boy just gettin
started with dem biblical allusions, son.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:03:00.380
The title ripped straight from “The Battle
Hymn of the Republic,” a sick 1860s beat spittin somethin raw:

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:06.180
haters beware, cuz the big G-man gonna smite yo ass one day just like he say in Revelation.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.900
But it’s exactly all this bible
jive that Jim Casy throws to the curb

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.920
when he goes to in to the wilderness to do some
soul searchin.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:18.380
Ol' JC realize that holiness ain’t about which book you readin or what God you preachin —

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.540
goodness comes from unity, brotha.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:35.140
As the story go on, the Joads keep
gettin f**ked by dem shysti bankers and landowners

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:39.840
to the point where they gotta live like animals, and start droppin one by one.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:42.940
But even though all them deaths makin the Joad family smaller,

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:46.660
the suffering they gotta beast through makes em part of a bigger crew.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.580
So when Rose of Sharon whips out
her titty to feed dat lucky fool at the end,

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:18.120
it symbolizing that she now part of a bigger
family — a family of people who been fu**ed by the man.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:44.160
Maybe the American dream of
opportunity for all ain’t everything it's cracked up to be.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:47.460
The rich get richer. The
poor get poorer.

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:52.220
But all the sweet swag you can find
at my store is EXACTLY what it’s all cracked up to be.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:56.300
So keep it real and check me out
next week. Peace.

